<title>GERMANY: RWE H1 96/97 group net profit rises 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>RWE H1 96/97 group net profit rises 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end December</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   573     up 7.7 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales				  36,091  vs 32,457</p>
